# Benchmark suite summary

Protocol: results/mlx/BENCH_PROTOCOL.md. tok/s: mean +- sd [95% CI], CV, n (timed reps, flagged blocks excluded). Energy: IOReport GPU rail over the test window, estimated (SoC rails); none for llama-bench (its window includes model load).

