Weights: ours / mlx-lm: mlx-community 4-bit g64; ours caches MLA latents, mlx-lm expanded K/V; llama.cpp / Ollama: mradermacher Q4_K_M; LM Studio (its MLX engine) and vllm-mlx: the mlx-community 4-bit

